    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d157">

                <pb facs="0280" n="274" sameAs="frus:frus1901China/pg274"/>

                <head><hi rendition="#italic">Mr. Rockhill to Mr. Hay.</hi></head>
                <opener>
                    <seg rendition="#float-left">No. 133.]</seg>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Commissioner of the United States to China</hi>,<lb/><hi
                                rendition="#italic">Peking, China</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1901-07-15"><hi rendition="#italic">July 15,
                                1901</hi></date>.</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p><hi rendition="#small-caps">Sir</hi>: For your information in connection with my
                    No. 129, of the 3d instant, I have the honor to inclose herewith copy of the
                    approved draft of the proclamation referred to therein as having been agreed
                    upon to issue in the name of the powers, reciting the events which brought about
                    the occupation by the foreign forces of the province and the conditions under
                    which they now evacuate it.</p>
                <p>This proclamation will shortly be published and posted throughout the
                    province.</p>
                <p>I am, etc.,</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">W. W. Rockhill.</hi></signed></closer>



                <xi:include href="d157-a1.xml" xpointer="d157-a1"/>
            </div>
